{"id":"n55880-1-9","stage":4,"title":"목장 · 牧场","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55880-1-9-1","ko":"이 말들을 기르는 사람이 혹시 여기에 있나요?","zh":"养这些马的人会在这里吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"말들을","meaning":"马","explanation":"말：马；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53068","senseId":"1","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말들을","audio":"/audio/b2bc68bc21e7fe505c3a.mp3"}},{"text":"기르는","meaning":"养，喂养，饲养，栽培","explanation":"기르다：养，喂养，饲养，栽培；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"기르다","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62242","senseId":"1","lemma":"기르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기르는","audio":"/audio/6a12b4f167fdd0e087ad.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이","audio":"/audio/3f33d9d6ca9be288c4e3.mp3"}},{"text":"혹시","meaning":"是不是，是否","explanation":"혹시：是不是，是否。","readings":[{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87955","senseId":"4","lemma":"혹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}},{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기에","audio":"/audio/89d8715c5ec0d5fb9df5.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"马","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"53068","definition":"身体主要呈褐色、黑色、白色，脸、颈、腿长，颈上有鬃，尾生长毛的动物。","pronunciation":["말"]},{"id":"8b121394eb596253","term":"기르다","zh":"养，喂养，饲养，栽培","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3","entryId":"62242","definition":"给动物食物或给植物养分，并予以保护，使其成长。","pronunciation":["기르다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"c99406fc3132c80d","term":"혹시","zh":"是不是，是否","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3","entryId":"87955","definition":"用于对不确定的事情提出疑问，表示虽认为如此，但因不确定而犹豫要不要说。","pronunciation":["혹씨"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8ba7556088af62ab1385.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55880-1-9-2","ko":"예. 제가 이 목장의 주인입니다만, 무슨 일이시죠?","zh":"是的，我就是这个牧场的主人，有什么事情吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"예.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"예：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"예","audio":"/audio/2eb73fba696e2fe4ea0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73966","senseId":